# Bolas's Citadel permits a life-paid top cast; Mystic Forge separately permits artifact or colorless spells from the top
# for their mana costs. With both in play the player chooses which permission a cast is made by (CR 601.2b): here
# Citadel's, so Sol Ring costs 1 life and none of the mana that is in the pool.
# Rules: CR 601.3 (a permission is required to cast), 601.2b and 118.9 (choose the cost for the permission used).
